  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COE BUP - SWM course dev - BUP - SWM Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">COE BUP - SWM-kursutveckl</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det redan tidigare Sida-st&#xf6;dda Baltic University Programme kommer nu att utveckla programmet &quot;Sustainable Water Programme&quot; med hj&#xe4;lp av ett antal experter inom universiteten. Experterna kommer fr&#xe5;n sex olika universitet i &#xd6;stersj&#xf6;omr&#xe5;det. M&#xe5;lgruppen &#xe4;r l&#xe4;rare ochstudenter vid universitet och h&#xf6;gskolor fr&#xe5;n 14 l&#xe4;nder i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The already supported project Baltic University Programme will now develop the programme &quot;Sustainable Water Programme&quot; with assistance of some experts from six different universities in countries in the Baltic Sea region. The target group for the programme consists of students and teachers from universities and high schools in the region</narrative>
  </description>
